{
    "title": "Beauty Camera - Selfie, Makeup",
    "description": "<b>Beauty Camera - Selfie, Makeup is an innovative and comprehensive app designed to snap perfect selfies/videos and edit photos with beauty touch-up and professional editing tools. Beauty Camera - Sweet Snap with a range of advanced features: achieve flawless and clean skin, makeup effects, aesthetic filters, funny stickers and reshape your face.</b> Beauty Camera allows you to beautify your selfies using natural beauty camera beauty techniques.\r\n\r\n<b>Selfie Camera with the standout feature of beautifying your selfies with makeup in just one tap.</b> Makeup camera with trendy looks, smooth skin, brighten eyes, make lips plumper, remove acne, whiten teeth, slim face and body. You can customize eye makeup, contour, foundation, blush, retouch eye shape, try contacts to change eye color. \ud83d\udd25\r\n\r\n<b>Beauty Camera also elevate your photo-editing experience by providing numerous photo editing tools, amazing collages, frames, animated effects, enhanced lighting, beauty color filters and makeup options.</b> With the help of Beauty Camera & Sweet Camera, you can give your selfies a touch of glamour, create artistic masterpieces and revive old memories. \r\n\r\nDownload Beauty Camera - Selfie, Makeup now to take and share your glamorous photos and videos on social media and make every moment more special. \ud83e\udd33\ud83d\udcaf\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc51 <b>Selfie Camera with AI Retouch, Face Tune</b> \r\n- <b>Beautify photos:</b> HD camera and adjusting tools take your selfie to the next level\r\n- <b>AI Retouch:</b> Artificial intelligence with filters and stickers make your photos more gorgeous\r\n- <b>Smooth skin:</b> refine your pores and enhance your natural beauty with precision\r\n- <b>Reshape face:</b> touch-up your face, eyes, nose, lips and more\r\n- <b>Makeup looks:</b> various makeup looks from daily to trendy makeup\r\n- <b>Beauty touch-up:</b> whiten teeth, remove blemish, enlarge and brighten your eyes and remove dark circles\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc96 <b>Beauty Filters, Makeup, Stickers Make You Perfect</b>\r\n- <b>Trendy makeup:</b> an array of makeup looks, a variety of lipstick, blushes, colored contacts, etc. \r\n- <b>Beauty filters:</b> Use filter camera to add style and flair to your photos\r\n- <b>AR stickers:</b> Add hundreds of special AR funny stickers to photos and try the latest makeup trends in a second\r\n- <b>Real-time AR makeovers:</b> Lipstick, eyeliner, eye color, eyelashes, face slimming, reshape cheekbones, chin, jaw, forehead\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Change Background and Professional Photo Editor</b>\r\n- <b>Photo Enhancement:</b> enhances image quality, restores colors, and brings clarity to your photos\r\n- <b>Background eraser:</b> Change background to give your photos a fresh look. Set the perfect backdrop for your moments and make each photo a unique narrative.\r\n- <b>Photo Editor:</b> Crop photo editor allows easy resizing and trimming \r\n- <b>Powerful features:</b> This smart tool effortlessly fine-tunes your photos and transform each picture into a magical work of art.\r\n\r\n\u2702\ufe0f <b>Beauty Editor, Collage Maker, Video Editor</b>\r\n- <b>Video Editor:</b> Make every selfie videos fancy with high-quality AR makeup and beauty effects\r\n- <b>Selfie Editor:</b> HD Retouch for a natural, stunning result in just one tap\r\n- <b>Collage Maker:</b> A wide variety of templates and styles and combine your favorite photos into beautiful layouts for storytelling\r\n- <b>Easily edit photos:</b> Adjust brightness, contrast, and colors, giving your pictures the perfect look\r\n\r\nBeauty Camera - Selfie, Makeup, HD Camera is the perfect all-in-one camera app and photo/video editing app packed with trendy makeup filters, stickers, AI retouch feature. Download it to spruce up your photos and videos for Instagram, Facebook, Pinterest, Snapchat, TikTok, Twitter, and enjoy the admiration of your followers! \ud83d\udc69\u2728",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Beauty Camera - Selfie, Makeup is an innovative and comprehensive app designed to snap perfect selfies/videos and edit photos with beauty touch-up and professional editing tools. Beauty Camera - Sweet Snap with a range of advanced features: achieve flawless and clean skin, makeup effects, aesthetic filters, funny stickers and reshape your face.</b> Beauty Camera allows you to beautify your selfies using natural beauty camera beauty techniques.<br><br><b>Selfie Camera with the standout feature of beautifying your selfies with makeup in just one tap.</b> Makeup camera with trendy looks, smooth skin, brighten eyes, make lips plumper, remove acne, whiten teeth, slim face and body. You can customize eye makeup, contour, foundation, blush, retouch eye shape, try contacts to change eye color. \ud83d\udd25<br><br><b>Beauty Camera also elevate your photo-editing experience by providing numerous photo editing tools, amazing collages, frames, animated effects, enhanced lighting, beauty color filters and makeup options.</b> With the help of Beauty Camera &amp; Sweet Camera, you can give your selfies a touch of glamour, create artistic masterpieces and revive old memories. <br><br>Download Beauty Camera - Selfie, Makeup now to take and share your glamorous photos and videos on social media and make every moment more special. \ud83e\udd33\ud83d\udcaf<br><br>\ud83d\udc51 <b>Selfie Camera with AI Retouch, Face Tune</b> <br>- <b>Beautify photos:</b> HD camera and adjusting tools take your selfie to the next level<br>- <b>AI Retouch:</b> Artificial intelligence with filters and stickers make your photos more gorgeous<br>- <b>Smooth skin:</b> refine your pores and enhance your natural beauty with precision<br>- <b>Reshape face:</b> touch-up your face, eyes, nose, lips and more<br>- <b>Makeup looks:</b> various makeup looks from daily to trendy makeup<br>- <b>Beauty touch-up:</b> whiten teeth, remove blemish, enlarge and brighten your eyes and remove dark circles<br><br>\ud83d\udc96 <b>Beauty Filters, Makeup, Stickers Make You Perfect</b><br>- <b>Trendy makeup:</b> an array of makeup looks, a variety of lipstick, blushes, colored contacts, etc. <br>- <b>Beauty filters:</b> Use filter camera to add style and flair to your photos<br>- <b>AR stickers:</b> Add hundreds of special AR funny stickers to photos and try the latest makeup trends in a second<br>- <b>Real-time AR makeovers:</b> Lipstick, eyeliner, eye color, eyelashes, face slimming, reshape cheekbones, chin, jaw, forehead<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 <b>Change Background and Professional Photo Editor</b><br>- <b>Photo Enhancement:</b> enhances image quality, restores colors, and brings clarity to your photos<br>- <b>Background eraser:</b> Change background to give your photos a fresh look. Set the perfect backdrop for your moments and make each photo a unique narrative.<br>- <b>Photo Editor:</b> Crop photo editor allows easy resizing and trimming <br>- <b>Powerful features:</b> This smart tool effortlessly fine-tunes your photos and transform each picture into a magical work of art.<br><br>\u2702\ufe0f <b>Beauty Editor, Collage Maker, Video Editor</b><br>- <b>Video Editor:</b> Make every selfie videos fancy with high-quality AR makeup and beauty effects<br>- <b>Selfie Editor:</b> HD Retouch for a natural, stunning result in just one tap<br>- <b>Collage Maker:</b> A wide variety of templates and styles and combine your favorite photos into beautiful layouts for storytelling<br>- <b>Easily edit photos:</b> Adjust brightness, contrast, and colors, giving your pictures the perfect look<br><br>Beauty Camera - Selfie, Makeup, HD Camera is the perfect all-in-one camera app and photo/video editing app packed with trendy makeup filters, stickers, AI retouch feature. Download it to spruce up your photos and videos for Instagram, Facebook, Pinterest, Snapchat, TikTok, Twitter, and enjoy the admiration of your followers! \ud83d\udc69\u2728",
